# No watch rule, on purpose, and this file exists to say why rather than to be
# missing.
#
# Upstream and this packaging are the same Git repository. No upstream tarball
# has ever been published and there is no release tag: the orig tarball is
# generated from the tree at build time, as debian/README.source describes. So
# there is no location uscan could poll, which is the situation uscan(1) and
# lintian expect a comments-only watch file to document.
#
# When upstream starts publishing release tags, replace this with a mode=git
# rule against refs/tags. Do not add one before then -- a rule that resolves to
# nothing is worse than a file that states the truth.
